OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner 'picked on' in listed
OL,4,Abuilding row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop owner who put up signage on a
OL,7,Flisted building without permission said
OL,8,Fhe feels "picked on" after being warned
OL,9,Fby the council he could face arrest.
OL,11,FPaul Clarke and his brother, David
OL,12,FClarke, opened Clarke Aquatics, in July
OL,13,Fin a Grade II listed building on Port
OL,14,FStreet, Evesham.
OL,16,FBut before the shop's grand opening,
OL,17,FPaul received a call from Wychavon
OL,18,FDistrict Council instructing him to
OL,19,Fremove some of the window coverings
OL,20,Fafter failing to secure planning
OL,21,Fpermission.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
