OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner 'picked on' in listed
OL,4,Abuilding row
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan MacLeod, from the council's
OL,7,Fplanning and infrastructure department,
OL,8,Fsaid: We want all businesses in our
OL,9,Fdistrict to thrive, however, we also
OL,10,Fhave a duty to ensure we apply the
OL,11,Frules consistently and fairly to
OL,12,Feveryone."
